@startsalt
skinparam defaultFontName PT Sans
skinparam dpi 160
{+
  <b>Сравнение маршрутов: composition и источник содержимого</b>
  {#
  Роль | Native | Delegated hosted | Exact-plan hosted
  Composer | Launcher | Caller-side manager | Caller до handoff
  Construction | Общий site | Тот же site | Тот же site
  Home | Managed home | Live managed home | Private snapshot
  Binding | Fragment | Pin + fragment digest | Sealed plan + receipts
  Host | Нет | Lifetime + native state | Lifetime + snapshot refs
  Предел | Native lifecycle | Нет immutable input | Нужна qualification
  }
  Hosted направления — ⟦решено⟧, не activation certificate.
  Hosted refusal не разрешает native fallback.
}
@endsalt
